+++ .gitignore (修改后)
# Examples

    Input:
    ### Added files:
    [src/main.py, README.md, config.json]

    ### Deleted files:
    [old/unused.py]
    ### Modified files:
    [utils.py]
    ###current .gitignore Content
    (empty)
    Expected Output:
    (empty — output nothing)

# Example 2 (Project with artifacts):
Input:
### Added files:
[pycache/main.cpython-310.pyc, dist/app.js, .env.local, .vscode/settings.json

### Deleted files:
    []

### Modified files:
[]
### current .gitignore Content
*.log
Expected Output:
    #Compiled and build artifacts
    *.pyc
    pycache/
    *.o
    *.obj
    dist/
    build/
    #Dependencies
    .venv/
    venv/
    node_modules/
    #Logs and temp files
    *.log
    *.tmp
    *.swp
    #Environment
    .env
    .env.local
    .env.
    #Editors
    .vscode/
    .idea/
    #Original rules preserved
    *.log